# Repulsive Mutation with X = 1 on Elvish Mystic, in response to Bot2's Lightning Bolt: the counter comes first, so the
# greatest power among Bot1's creatures is then 2, and Bot2 (its only Mountain tapped for the Bolt) cannot pay it.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Elvish Mystic
Repulsive Mutation
Forest x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Mountain x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Elvish Mystic.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Repulsive Mutation.Cast(X: 1)
Bot1.Target(Bot1.Battlefield.Elvish Mystic)
Bot1.Target(Stack.Lightning Bolt)

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 20
Bot2.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt
Bot1.Battlefield.Elvish Mystic.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Elvish Mystic.Power = 2
